{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17621","headline":"上元日紫极宫门观州民然灯张乐 · 羊士谔","name":"上元日紫极宫门观州民然灯张乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山郭通衢隘，瑶坛紫府深。\n灯花助春意，舞绶织欢心。\n闲似淮阳卧，恭闻乐职吟。\n唯将圣明化，聊以达飞沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17621.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17621","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}